<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE PLAY-OFF SEMIFINAL FIRST LEG RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE PLAY-OFF SEMIFINAL FIRST LEG RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of English league soccer</p>
<p>play-off semifinal first leg matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Division two</p>
<p> Bristol City	 1     Brentford	2</p>
<p> Crewe		  2     Luton	    1</p>
<p>Division three</p>
<p> Cardiff		0     Northampton    1</p>
<p> Chester		0     Swansea	  0</p>
<p>Played Saturday:</p>
<p>Division one</p>
